# Data — everything except what we publish or keep on purpose.
# The SQLite database and the trained model are rebuilt every run; the
# artifacts are what the site serves, and data/history/ is our own copy of
# each completed gameweek, which is the whole point of archiving it.
data/*
!data/artifacts/
!data/history/

